Gumagana ba ang rice cooker?

222
00:16:02.504 --> 00:16:04.422
Kung hindi,
Bibigyan kita ng 100% refund.

223
00:16:05.256 --> 00:16:06.800
It was nice meeting you kanina din.

224
00:16:09.969 --> 00:16:10.845
